{{!-- Full-width centred emphasis. One shape covers every banner in the
      reference cards: a plain DC line, a tinted outcome banner, and the versus
      separator, which is a prominent centre term between two muted ones.

      The centre may be text, an icon, or both. Putting the icon inside the centre
      span rather than beside it means it scales with the term -- a large band
      gets a large icon without a second rule saying so. --}}
<div class="cpb-part-band{{#if tone}} cpb-tone-{{tone}}{{/if}}{{#if size}} cpb-band-{{size}}{{/if}}{{#if quiet}} cpb-band-quiet{{/if}}{{#if align}} cpb-align-{{align}}{{/if}}">
    {{#if lead}}<span class="cpb-part-band-flank">{{{lead}}}</span>{{/if}}
    <span class="cpb-part-band-text">{{#if icon}}<i class="{{icon}}"></i>{{/if}}{{#if text}}{{#if icon}} {{/if}}{{{text}}}{{/if}}</span>
    {{#if trail}}<span class="cpb-part-band-flank">{{{trail}}}</span>{{/if}}
</div>
